OL,5,G0232FAssignment
OL,6,     GIn Normandy, in north-west
OL,7,     GFrance, coastal erosion is a
OL,8,     Gserious and growing problem
OL,9,     Gbecause of rising sea levels. But
OL,10,     Gthere is a dispute about what to
OL,11,     Gdo about it.
