OL,13,G0306FOutlook
OL,14,     GAntony Penrose knew his mother
OL,15,     GLee Miller was a famous
OL,16,     Gphotographer, but she never
OL,17,     Gtalked about her experiences in
OL,18,     GWorld War Two. He didn't find out
OL,19,     Gwhy until after she died.
